<title>CHINA: KOREA EXCHANGE SEEN SEEKING US$ FUNDS.</title>
<headline>KOREA EXCHANGE SEEN SEEKING US$ FUNDS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Exchange Bank is seen tapping the offshore debt market for funds, bankers said.</p>
<p>They expected the size of the debt issue to be around US$200 million, with an effective tenor of one year.</p>
<p>The issuer is rated Baa1 by Moody's Investors Service but the ratings agency placed the issuer under review for a possible downgrade last month.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong News Room (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
